                    <span class="choice-desc">以守为攻，减少受到的伤害，寻找反击机会。</span>
                </div>
                <div class="choice-btn" onclick="combatAction('skill')">
                    <span class="choice-title">施展法术/战技</span>
                    <span class="choice-desc">消耗大量魔力/体力，但威力巨大。</span>
                </div>
                <div class="choice-btn" onclick="combatAction('flee')">
                    <span class="choice-title">尝试逃跑</span>
                    <span class="choice-desc">保全性命优先，但可能失败并遭受追击。</span>
